DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261014T210000
SUMMARY:Abbie McCarthy's Good Karma Club Presents: Precious Pepala
LOCATION:London Barfly\, Chalk Farm
DESCRIPTION:Abbie McCarthy is an award-winning broadcaster who has champion
 
ed artists on the live scene for the last decade. This club night has provi
 
ded early shows for so many brilliant artists over the years\, including th
 
